---
description: Do not use the copyright symbol on product or platform names
alwaysApply: true
---

Do not use the © symbol on product or platform names (e.g. write "TMU", "TestMaster Universe", "WebETest", not "TMU©" / "WebETest©"). The old hdmaster.com site often appended © to those names — omit it when adapting that content. Keep normal copyright notices for the company/year (e.g. footer "© 2026 Headmaster LLP") when appropriate.
